    rdfs:label "Sekimura et al. (2000) Proc. R. Soc. B, Madzvamuse et al. (2002) J. Math. Biol. & Thompson et al. (2014) Nature anisotropic Gierer–Meinhardt butterfly wing pattern formation and Batesian mimicry polymorphism in Papilio dardanus (Papilio dardanus (African mocker swallowtail female mimetic morphs: hippocoonides, trophonius, cenea, planemoides))",
        "Sekimura et al. (2000) Proc. R. Soc. B, Madzvamuse et al. (2002) J. Math. Biol. & Thompson et al. (2014) Nature anisotropic Gierer–Meinhardt butterfly wing pattern formation and Batesian mimicry polymorphism in Papilio dardanus faithfully reproduces Papilio dardanus (African mocker swallowtail female mimetic morphs: hippocoonides, trophonius, cenea, planemoides) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sekimura-papilio-wing-stripe-mimicry-1>,
